    [
     1,
     "Thank you for the quick response.<p>I am sorry but none of the examples shows a set_attribute in a function(){}. <p>I have 2 attributes where the value of one is dependent on the other. I want to set the value of the second attribute at the same time I am sampling that of the first one (as in my example above, setting weight right after sampling a value for height).<p>Can you please share a link to a resource containing something similar?<p>Thank you.</p></p></p></p>"
